OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786457920
OL,3,CHeathrow overtaken by Istanbul as
OL,4,CEurope's busiest airport
OL,6,FHeathrow airport said "the case for
OL,7,Fexpansion has never been clearer"
OL,8,Fafter it lost its position as Europe's
OL,9,Fbusiest airport to Istanbul.
OL,11,FFigures published by the west London
OL,12,Fairport show 7.86 million passengers
OL,13,Fpassed through its four terminals in
OL,14,FJuly whereas its Turkish counterpart
OL,15,Frecorded 8.15 million passengers over
OL,16,Fthe same period.
OL,18,FAnnual figures from trade body
OL,19,FAirports Council International show
OL,20,FHeathrow was Europe's busiest airport
OL,21,Ffrom 1996 to 2019.
OL,26,@nD@WOUoD@aO]
