FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786457920
OL,3,CHeathrow overtaken by Istanbul as
OL,4,CEurope's busiest airport
OL,6,FIt lost that position in 2020 amid
OL,7,Fcoronavirus travel restrictions before
OL,8,Fregaining it in 2023 and holding the
OL,9,Ftitle since then.
OL,11,FHeathrow's July passenger total
OL,12,Frepresented a 1.5% decrease compared
OL,13,Fwith the same month last year, whereas
OL,14,FIstanbul saw a 2.3% boost.
OL,16,FThe Iran-US conflict has had an impact
OL,17,Fon Heathrow's passenger traffic.
OL,19,FIts passenger numbers on Middle East
OL,20,Froutes in July were down 20.2% year-on-
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/7
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786457920
OL,3,CHeathrow overtaken by Istanbul as
OL,4,CEurope's busiest airport
OL,6,FDespite this, Heathrow continues to
OL,7,Foperate its two runways at near-full
OL,8,Fcapacity, and is seeking Government
OL,9,Fpermission to build a third.
OL,11,FAn expansion proposal by the airport's
OL,12,Fowners would enable it to accommodate
OL,13,F150 million passengers per year.
OL,15,FIt recorded 84.46 million passengers
OL,16,Fin 2025.
OL,18,FHeathrow said in a statement:
OL,19,F"Heathrow is operating at capacity.
OL,26,@{D@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/7
