OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786457920
OL,3,CHeathrow overtaken by Istanbul as
OL,4,CEurope's busiest airport
OL,6,F"The case for expansion has never been
OL,7,Fclearer, as Heathrow was overtaken in
OL,8,FJuly by Istanbul airport as the
OL,9,Fbusiest hub in Europe.
OL,11,F"Our plans will ensure the country
OL,12,Fgets the infrastructure it needs to
OL,13,Fstay competitive and will deliver all-
OL,14,Fimportant economic growth."
OL,16,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,17,Flaunched a consultation on the renamed
OL,18,FHeathrow expansion national policy
OL,19,Fstatement in June, setting out the
OL,20,Fconditions needed if the project is to
OL,21,Fbe given the go-ahead.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@[O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/7
