PN,37405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786457920
OL,3,CHeathrow overtaken by Istanbul as
OL,4,CEurope's busiest airport
OL,6,FThen-chancellor Rachel Reeves said at
OL,7,Fthe time she was determined to get
OL,8,F"spades in the ground" for the third
OL,9,Frunway in the current Parliament, and
OL,10,Ffor it to be built by 2035.
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham, who
OL,13,Fsacked Ms Reeves, previously expressed
OL,14,Fconcerns over Heathrow expansion,
OL,15,Fstating the plans divert
OL,16,Finfrastructure investment "away from
OL,17,Fthe North and traps it in London".
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@VO]xD@[OUyD@aO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/7
