PN,37406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786457920
OL,3,CHeathrow overtaken by Istanbul as
OL,4,CEurope's busiest airport
OL,6,FHeathrow said July 19 was its busiest
OL,7,Fday of the year so far as many schools
OL,8,Fbroke up for summer, with 267,000
OL,9,Fpassengers recorded.
OL,11,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,12,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,13,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,14,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,16,FIt added that several new airlines
OL,17,Fbegan serving the airport last month,
OL,18,Fwhich demonstrates "clear demand for
OL,19,Faccess to Heathrow".
OL,26,@zD@TOU{D@SO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/7
