OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1786457920
OL,3,CHeathrow overtaken by Istanbul as
OL,4,CEurope's busiest airport
OL,6,FThey include ITA Airways from Italy,
OL,7,FAlaska Airlines from the US and Riyadh
OL,8,FAir from Saudi Arabia.
OL,10,FHeathrow chief executive Thomas
OL,11,FWoldbye said summer is "off to a
OL,12,Fflying start" but "we want to go
OL,13,Ffurther" by "growing our route network
OL,14,Fand passenger offering".
OL,16,FHe continued: "Expanding Heathrow will
OL,17,Fhelp ensure the UK remains home to
OL,18,FEurope's leading hub and continues to
OL,19,Fbenefit from the trade, investment and
OL,20,Ftourism that increased connectivity
OL,21,Fwill bring."
OL,26,@sD@XOUtD@MO]tD@SOUuD@HO]uD@MOUvD@WO]xD@
